{
  "info": {
    "name": "Élan API",
    "description": "Collection de test de l'API Élan (Express + SQLite).\n\n## Démarrage rapide\n1. Démarrer le serveur : `npm run server` (ou `cd server && npm run dev`).\n2. Ouvrir la collection, onglet **Variables**.\n3. `baseUrl` = `http://localhost:3001/api` en local, ou `https://VOTRE-URL.onrender.com/api` sur Render.\n4. Exécuter **Authentification → Connexion client** : le token est enregistré automatiquement dans la variable `token`.\n5. Les requêtes protégées utilisent déjà l'en-tête `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\n\n## Comptes de démonstration (mot de passe : `password123`)\n| Rôle | E-mail |\n|---|---|\n| Client | thomas.lefebvre@example.com |\n| Vendeur | vendeur@elan.com |\n\n> Le token est un jeton signé (HMAC), pas un JWT : il n'a pas de date d'expiration.\n\n> Sur le plan gratuit Render, la première requête peut prendre 30 à 50 secondes (réveil du service).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "panier-fruits-bio" },
    { "key": "sellerId", "value": "seller-elan" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "addressId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "reviewId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 · Diagnostic",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Vérifie que l'API répond. Aucune authentification requise.\n\nRéponse attendue : `200 { \"status\": \"ok\", \"service\": \"Élan E-Commerce API\", ... }`"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Statut 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Service en ligne', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Authentification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Connexion client",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"thomas.lefebvre@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "Enregistre automatiquement le `token` renvoyé dans la variable de collection."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Connexion réussie (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Token présent', () => pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "if (body.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "  console.log('Token enregistré pour', body.user.email, '(', body.user.role, ')');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Connexion vendeur",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"vendeur@elan.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "Remplace le `token` par celui du vendeur, nécessaire pour les routes `/products` (POST/PATCH/DELETE), `/seller/*` et `/uploads`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('sellerId', body.seller && body.seller.id ? body.seller.id : pm.collectionVariables.get('sellerId'));",
                  "  console.log('Token vendeur enregistré :', body.user.email);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mon profil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
            "description": "Renvoie l'utilisateur et la boutique associée au token. `401` si le token est absent ou invalide."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 ou 401', () => pm.expect([200, 401]).to.include(pm.response.code));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Inscription client",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test Postman\",\n  \"email\": \"test.postman@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"customer\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "description": "`201` à la création, `409` si l'e-mail existe déjà. Pour un vendeur, ajouter `\"role\": \"seller\"` et `\"shopName\": \"Ma boutique\"`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 · Produits",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liste des produits",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
            "description": "Catalogue complet. Public, sans token.\n\nAstuce : ajouter un test qui enregistre le premier `id` dans `productId`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const list = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Au moins un produit', () => pm.expect(list.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "if (Array.isArray(list) && list.length) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', list[0].id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('sellerId', list[0].sellerId);",
                  "  console.log('productId =', list[0].id, '| sellerId =', list[0].sellerId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Un produit",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}",
            "description": "`404` si l'identifiant n'existe pas."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Créer un produit (vendeur)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Produit test Postman\",\n  \"description\": \"Créé depuis Postman\",\n  \"price\": 49.9,\n  \"stock\": 5,\n  \"category\": \"Accessoires\",\n  \"images\": [\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523275335684-37898b6baf30?w=800&q=80\"]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
            "description": "Nécessite un token **vendeur** (`403` avec un compte client, `401` sans token)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Modifier un produit (vendeur)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"price\": 39.9,\n  \"stock\": 12\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Supprimer un produit (vendeur)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}",
            "description": "Supprime uniquement un produit appartenant au vendeur connecté."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 · Boutiques",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liste des boutiques",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/sellers"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const list = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (Array.isArray(list) && list.length) { pm.collectionVariables.set('sellerId', list[0].id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Une boutique",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/sellers/{{sellerId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Produits d'une boutique",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/sellers/{{sellerId}}/products"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5 · Commandes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Mes commandes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
            "description": "Commandes de l'utilisateur connecté (ou du vendeur : celles qui le concernent)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Une commande",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Créer une commande",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\", \"quantity\": 1 }\n  ],\n  \"shippingAddress\": \"12 rue de la Paix, 75002 Paris\",\n  \"deliveryMode\": \"standard\",\n  \"shippingCost\": 4.9,\n  \"status\": \"pending\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
            "description": "Décrémente le stock. `409` si le stock est insuffisant. `deliveryMode` : `standard` ou `express`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const order = body.order || body;",
                  "  if (order && order.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', order.id); }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Changer le statut (vendeur)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"shipped\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status",
            "description": "Réservé au vendeur concerné par la commande."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6 · Paiement Stripe",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Créer un PaymentIntent",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\", \"quantity\": 1 }\n  ],\n  \"shippingMode\": \"standard\",\n  \"shippingCost\": 4.9\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/payments/create-intent",
            "description": "Le montant est recalculé côté serveur à partir du catalogue : impossible de le falsifier depuis le client.\n\nRéponse : `{ clientSecret, amount, currency }`. Le `clientSecret` sert ensuite dans l'app avec `@stripe/stripe-react-native`.\n\n`500` si `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` est absente ou invalide côté serveur."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 attendu', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('clientSecret présent', () => pm.expect(body.clientSecret).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "console.log('Montant facturé :', body.amount, body.currency);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7 · Favoris",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Mes favoris",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/favorites"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ids des favoris",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/favorites/ids"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Basculer un favori",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/favorites/{{productId}}/toggle",
            "description": "Ajoute le produit aux favoris s'il n'y est pas, le retire sinon."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "8 · Avis",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Avis d'un produit",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/reviews/product/{{productId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Publier un avis",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"rating\": 5,\n  \"comment\": \"Excellent produit, testé depuis Postman.\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/reviews"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const review = body.review || body;",
                  "if (review && review.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('reviewId', review.id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Supprimer un avis",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "9 · Codes promo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Valider un code promo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"productId\": \"sacoche-cuir-minimal\", \"quantity\": 2 }\n  ],\n  \"couponCode\": \"POSTMAN10\",\n  \"shippingCost\": 4.9\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/coupons/validate",
            "description": "Renvoie le détail du prix : sous-total, remise, livraison, total.\n\n⚠️ Règle métier : un code promo ne s'applique qu'aux produits du vendeur qui l'a créé. Un code du vendeur `seller-elan` sur un produit `seller-marche` renvoie `400 \"Ce code promo ne s'applique à aucun article de votre panier.\"`\n\nCodes disponibles :\n- `POSTMAN10` (10 %, créé via la requête « Créer un code promo », vendeur `vendeur@elan.com`)\n- `ELAN10` (10 %, minimum 50 $, fourni par les données de démo)\n\nLes deux ne fonctionnent que sur `sacoche-cuir-minimal` ou `robe-plissee`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "10 · Adresses",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Mes adresses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ajouter une adresse",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"label\": \"Maison\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Thomas Lefebvre\",\n  \"line1\": \"12 rue de la Paix\",\n  \"city\": \"Paris\",\n  \"postalCode\": \"75002\",\n  \"country\": \"France\",\n  \"phone\": \"+33612345678\",\n  \"isDefault\": true\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
